WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
KAIROS: The Golden Hour Rescue Platform. Accept Before You Move — ensuring the right hospital and right resources are confirmed before an ambulance departs.

00:05.500 --> 00:11.500
Step 1: The referring clinician captures structured ISBAR notes, five vital signs, and required facilities like ICU or Blood Bank in under sixty seconds.

00:11.500 --> 00:17.500
Step 2: KAIROS transparently matches receiving hospitals by verified ICU capacity, specialty readiness, and distance — with automatic five-minute escalation.

00:17.500 --> 00:23.500
Step 3: The receiving ER physician accepts the referral and soft-locks Bed 12A on a live countdown timer so no critical bed is ever double-promised.

00:23.500 --> 00:30.000
Step 4: Only after hospital acceptance — or a logged manual safety override — Ambulance KA-01 dispatches, streams live vitals and GPS ETA, and hands over to a prepared ED team.
